  "description": "<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Who Are We?</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">We are Huxie, a Danish brand dedicated to creating beautiful, durable, and sustainable baby products that effortlessly integrate into every family&rsquo;s life. Our products, made from 100% organic cotton, are designed to last from the baby stage through toddlerhood and beyond &ndash; perfect for parents who value quality and timeless design.</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Why Should You Share Huxie Products with Other Parents?</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Safe &amp; Sustainable: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400;\">Every Huxie product is crafted from 100% organic cotton, making them super soft and gentle for babies, while also kind to the planet &ndash; just what we all want as parents!</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Timeless, Minimalist Design: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400;\">Simple yet stylish, our Scandinavian-inspired designs fit seamlessly into any home. Whether it&rsquo;s for a cozy nursery or a family room, Huxie blends right in.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Comfort &amp; Warmth: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400;\">From bath time to bedtime, Huxie&rsquo;s products keep little ones snug and comfy. They hold up incredibly well after countless washes (because, let&rsquo;s face it, babies mean lots of laundry!).</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Built to Last: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400;\">These aren&rsquo;t just baby and toddler products &ndash; they&rsquo;re made to be passed down, whether to siblings or future generations, becoming part of your family&rsquo;s story.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">Versatile &amp; Neutral: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400;\">With soothing, neutral colors, Huxie products fit effortlessly into any space, making them an ideal choice for every home.</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 400;\"></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">What&rsquo;s in It for You?</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\">\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><strong>Earn 20% Commission: </strong>Earn a generous 20% commission on every sale made through your unique affiliate link.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 11p